{"The assertion `assert stats[\"total_items\"] > 0` at line 200 is race-prone: worker threads may process all 10 items before `get_stats()` is called, causing the assertion to fail": 0.9128072261810303, "The `create_thread_queue_parallel_worker` method reuses the same `self.queue_pool` instance across multiple calls to `create_with_partitions`. When Arroyo rebalances partitions, the previous strategy's `close()` already called `self.queue_pool.shutdown()`, so subsequent calls pass the shutdown pool to new `SimpleQueueProcessingStrategy` instances, causing `put()` operations to raise exceptions and break message processing": 0.9291049242019653}